title: 'Decision: a block kit.Button is not a decision key and runs only a safe command subset'
summary: A kit.Button inside a display block (agent or mod data) renders without the key class, dashed and distinct from kernel decision keys, and is live only for BLOCK_SAFE_COMMANDS (GUI commands minus diag.send and gui.reconnect); any other command renders inert.
